        <history>
            <p>Founded in 1986, Ubisoft is known for popular franchises such as "Assassin's Creed", "Far Cry", and "Rainbow Six".</p>
        </history>
        <milestones>
            <ul>
                <li year="2007">Release of "Assassin's Creed".</li>
                <li year="2012">Launch of "Far Cry 3".</li>
                <li year="2014">Release of "Watch Dogs".</li>
                <li year="2020">Launch of "Assassin's Creed Valhalla".</li>
                <li year="2021">Release of "Far Cry 6".</li>
            </ul>
        </milestones>
        <awards>
            <ul>
                <li year="2007">BAFTA Games Award for Best Game (Assassin's Creed).</li>
                <li year="2014">The Game Awards - Best Action/Adventure (Watch Dogs).</li>
            </ul>
        </awards>
        <current_projects>
            <p>Ubisoft has ongoing projects, including future titles in the "Assassin's Creed" and "Far Cry" franchises, as well as potential remasters of older games for next-gen consoles.</p>
